==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 30,000 and increases by 30,000 with each stage.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*20 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Super Hyppoh]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.
**2 [[Sir Seal]] spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

